{"questions":[{"id":"Q159-V5","typeId":"雙模式耗電","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S01:p5","S14:p4"],"variantOf":"Q159","variantIndex":5,"prompt":"定位器滿電可待機 102 小時或連續掃描 17 小時，兩模式互斥。啟用 31 小時後剛好沒電，掃描用了幾小時？","answer":"71/5","explanation":"掃描 x 小時、待機 31−x 小時，x/17+(31−x)/102＝1，得 x＝71/5。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x/17+(31-x)/102=1","root":"71/5","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"text":"71/5","id":"c1"},{"text":"84/5","misconception":"求成待機時間。","id":"c2"},{"text":"17","misconception":"忽略啟用期間還有待機耗電。","id":"c3"},{"text":"31/6","misconception":"將整段時間都按待機耗電後直接換算掃描時間。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q160-V1","typeId":"三模式耗電","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S01:p5"],"variantOf":"Q160","variantIndex":1,"prompt":"定位器三模式互斥：待機 192 小時、錄音 32 小時、定位 16 小時各可耗盡滿電。這次錄音 8 小時，待機時間是定位時間 4 倍，最後耗盡。定位幾小時？","answer":"9","explanation":"設定位 x 小時，8/32+4x/192+x/16＝1，解得 x＝9。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"8/32+4*x/192+x/16=1","root":"9","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"text":"36","misconception":"求成待機時間。","id":"c1"},{"text":"9","id":"c2"},{"text":"12","misconception":"忽略待機也耗電。","id":"c3"},{"text":"144/13","misconception":"將待機時間與定位時間當成一樣，漏掉四倍關係。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q160-V2","typeId":"三模式耗電","difficulty":"難","sourceRefs":["S01:p5"],"variantOf":"Q160","variantIndex":2,"prompt":"定位器三模式互斥：待機 288 小時、錄音 48 小時、定位 24 小時各可耗盡滿電。這次錄音 12 小時，待機時間是定位時間 4 倍，最後耗盡。定位幾小時？","answer":"27/2","explanation":"設定位 x 小時，12/48+4x/288+x/24＝1，解得 x＝13.5。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"12/48+4*x/288+x/24=1","root":"27/2","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"text":"54","misconception":"求成待機時間。","id":"c1"},{"text":"18","misconception":"忽略待機也耗電。","id":"c2"},{"text":"27/2","id":"c3"},{"text":"216/13","misconception":"將待機時間與定